{"ticker":"C","updated":"2026-10-30T22:38:07Z","profile":{"longName":"Citigroup Inc.","shortName":"Citigroup, Inc.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Banks - Diversified","country":"United States","website":"https://www.citigroup.com","fullTimeEmployees":217000,"marketCap":202993729536,"trailingPE":11.953216,"forwardPE":9.38763,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.4369287,"pegRatio":0.53,"targetMeanPrice":150.7143,"targetHighPrice":170.0,"targetLowPrice":127.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":21,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.08,"earningsGrowth":0.534,"grossMargins":0.0,"operatingMargins":0.34108,"profitMargins":0.23208,"totalRevenue":83299000320,"beta":1.111,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":147.96,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":95.83,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.13},"summary":"Citigroup Inc., a diversified financial service holding company, provides various financial products and services to consumers, corporations, governments, and institutions. It operates through five segments: Services, Markets, Banking, U.S. Personal Banking, and Wealth. The Services segment includes treasury and trade solutions, which provides cash management, trade, and working capital solutions to multinational corporations, financial institutions, and public sector organizations; and securities services, such as cross-border support for clients, local market expertise, post-trade technologies, data solutions, and various securities services solutions. The Markets segment offers sales and trading services for equities, foreign exchange, rates, spread products, and commodities to corporate, institutional, and public sector clients; and market-making services, including asset classes, risk management solutions, financing, and prime brokerage. The Banking segment includes investment banking services comprising equity and debt capital markets-related strategic financing solutions; advisory services related to mergers and acquisitions, divestitures, restructurings, and corporate defense activities; and corporate lending consists of corporate and commercial banking. The U.S. Personal Banking segment provides proprietary and co-branded card portfolios; and traditional banking servic","summary_zh":"花旗集團是一家多元化的金融服務控股公司，為消費者、企業、政府和機構提供各種金融產品和服務。它透過五個部門運作：服務部門、市場部門、銀行部門、美國個人銀行部門和財富部門。服務部門包括資金和貿易解決方案，為跨國公司、金融機構和公共部門組織提供現金管理、貿易和營運資金解決方案；和證券服務，例如為客戶提供跨境支援、本地市場專業知識、交易後技術、資料解決方案和各種證券服務解決方案。市場部門為企業、機構和公共部門客戶提供股票、外匯、利率、價差產品和大宗商品的銷售和交易服務；以及做市服務，包括資產類別、風險管理解決方案、融資和大宗經紀業務。銀行業務部門包括投資銀行服務，包括股權和債務資本市場相關的策略融資解決方案；與併購、資產剝離、重組和企業防禦活動相關的諮詢服務；企業貸款包括企業銀行和商業銀行業務。美國個人銀行業務部門提供自營和聯名卡組合；和傳統銀行服務","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"銀行 - 多元化","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":95.02,"h":95.02,"l":92.96,"c":94.78,"v":15128800},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":94.89,"h":95.24,"l":93.4,"c":95.03,"v":14158800},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":95.3,"h":97.15,"l":95.3,"c":97.08,"v":12900100},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":97.37,"h":97.98,"l":94.15,"c":95.4,"v":17020800},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":95.86,"h":95.97,"l":94.64,"c":95.87,"v":11398800},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":95.5,"h":98.14,"l":95.45,"c":97.34,"v":18101600},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":97.5,"h":98.38,"l":96.51,"c":97.17,"v":12238300},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":97.35,"h":99.04,"l":96.89,"c":98.82,"v":13426500},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":98.78,"h":99.7,"l":98.44,"c":99.44,"v":9502900},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":99.8,"h":100.17,"l":99.4,"c":99.79,"v":10620100},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":99.86,"h":100.85,"l":99.21,"c":100.64,"v":12350700},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":100.49,"h":102.21,"l":100.41,"c":101.76,"v":14371600},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":101.97,"h":102.7,"l":101.69,"c":102.41,"v":11677600},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":102.54,"h":103.13,"l":101.87,"c":102.68,"v":24745700},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":101.76,"h":103.81,"l":101.7,"c":103.49,"v":11474500},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":103.53,"h":105.59,"l":102.41,"c":103.0,"v":15747900},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":103.39,"h":104.07,"l":101.62,"c":101.65,"v":12272400},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":101.03,"h":102.26,"l":100.15,"c":102.11,"v":11232900},{"t":"2025-09-26","o"